# Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (Alibaba, 2026): a small model that tries three new things
# on top of the Qwen3-Next layout (12 x 3 Gated DeltaNet : 1 gated attention, all MoE).
#
#   - A gated residual (GR) stream of 4 copies replaces both the plain residual and the
#     pre-norms: each branch reads a gated mean of the normalized copies and writes its
#     output back to each copy with a weight of its own. The read before the head
#     replaces the final norm.
#   - Per-layer embeddings (PLE) before the second layer: an Engram memory of 51B
#     parameters, hashed bigram and trigram embeddings that add to each copy of the
#     stream with a gate of their own. N-grams stop at the end of a document.
#   - Every attention layer is sparse (QSA): a 4-head indexer scores keys pooled in
#     blocks of 4 and keeps the best 512 complete blocks (2048 keys) per query, and the
#     keys of its unfinished block.
#
# The Gated DeltaNet output gate is a sigmoid here, not a swish. The MTP layer continues
# from the widened stream before the main read, adds the next token's embedding to each
# copy, and reads its own copies back for the head. The vision encoder is not described.
d_model    = 2560
vocab_size = 248320
residual   = gr(expansion=4, rank=320)

norm    = rmsnorm(zero_centered=true)
delta   = gdn(num_heads=16, num_v_heads=48, head_dim=128, output_gate=sigmoid)
attn    = gqa(num_heads=24, num_kv_heads=2, head_dim=256, gated=true, qk_norm=norm,
              rope=rope(base=10000000, fraction=0.25),
              indexer=indexer(num_heads=4, head_dim=128, top_k=2048, block_size=4,
                              weighted=false, norm=norm))
experts = moe(num_experts=512, top_k=10, num_shared_experts=1, shared_expert_gate=true,
              aux_loss_coef=1e-3, expert=gated_mlp(intermediate_size=640, activation=swish))
ple     = engram(head_dim=160, table_size=20000000, max_ngram_size=3, norm=norm,
                 boundary_token=248044)

layer(mixer) = [mixer] [experts]
D = layer(delta)
A = layer(attn)

shared out = head
mtp = $h nextn(norm=norm) A out

model = embed D ple "DDA" "DDDA"^11 @h out mtp
